==English==
[[File:Ponticola ratan, Gulf of Odessa, Ukraine - 20110620-01.jpg|thumb|A Ratan goby (''[[w:Ponticola ratan|Ponticola ratan]]'') from the [[w:Gulf of Odessa|Gulf of Odessa]], [[w:Ukraine|Ukraine]]]]
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
From {{uder|en|la|gobius||gudgeon}}, from {{uder|en|grc|κωβιός|}}, a type of small fish, of unknown ultimate origin.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/ˈɡəʊbi/}}
* {{audio|en|LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vealhurl-goby.wav|Audio (Southern England)}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|goby|+}}

# Any of various small fish from the large family [[Gobiidae]], in which the [[pelvic fin]]s are fused to form a disc-shaped sucker.
# {{rfv-sense|en}} A [[gudgeon]], such as ''[[Gobio gobio]]''.

